[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 25260.788, "timestamp": "07:01:00", "text": "那。还有，亚当·巴比桑，谢谢你。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25263.03, "timestamp": "07:01:03", "text": "我最后摔倒了，呃，谢谢你。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25265.35, "timestamp": "07:01:05", "text": "超级留言。我最后睡着了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25266.868, "timestamp": "07:01:06", "text": "看着一根绳子。我喜欢"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25268.548, "timestamp": "07:01:08", "text": "白噪声。它能帮助我入睡。不"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25272.15, "timestamp": "07:01:12", "text": "忘记休息了。呃，谢谢。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25275.11, "timestamp": "07:01:15", "text": "是的，这就是Joathon。呃，在"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25279.27, "timestamp": "07:01:19", "text": "一开始，我想这么做，我做到了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25282.788, "timestamp": "07:01:22", "text": "呃，因为我想证明这一点。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25284.39, "timestamp": "07:01:24", "text": "我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25287.75, "timestamp": "07:01:27", "text": "嗯，我配得上这款新模型。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25290.23, "timestamp": "07:01:30", "text": "嗯，新模型完成了，艺术创作也完成了。这"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25292.868, "timestamp": "07:01:32", "text": "索具设备有点贵。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25295.99, "timestamp": "07:01:35", "text": "所以我也得付费购买许可证。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25298.07, "timestamp": "07:01:38", "text": "因为有人帮了我。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25301.43, "timestamp": "07:01:41", "text": "模型和所有东西。嗯，是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25304.39, "timestamp": "07:01:44", "text": "他将成为我为Jox设计的官方模特。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25306.07, "timestamp": "07:01:46", "text": "所以，我必须支付许可证费用。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25308.468, "timestamp": "07:01:48", "text": "用于索具。因此，它被向上取整了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25311.59, "timestamp": "07:01:51", "text": "大约 2000 美元，这就像"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25314.07, "timestamp": "07:01:54", "text": "现在数额很大。这不可能"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25316.628, "timestamp": "07:01:56", "text": "对我来说，像我这样的小频道"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25318.788, "timestamp": "07:01:58", "text": "比如现在就实现它。是的，就是这样。"}]